<title>USA: AMBAC says it qualifies five muni bond issues.</title>
<headline>AMBAC says it qualifies five muni bond issues.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said on Wednesday that it qualified for insurance the following five municipal bond issues scheduled for competitive sale:</p>
<p>--New Haven, Conn., General Obligations (GO), $40 million.</p>
<p>--Camanche Community School District, Iowa, $6.275 million.</p>
<p>--Lafourche Parish School District, Louis., GOs, $10 million.</p>
<p>--Holbrook, Mass., GOs $4.8 million.</p>
<p>--Knoxville, Tenn., GOs, $23.34 million.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
